---
description: Never log raw prompt text
---

The prompt-uplift layer must not log or restate raw user prompt text
outside the compilation flow.

The hook marker is content-free. Flag files are empty. State lives under
`PROMPT_UPLIFT_STATE_DIR` (or `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/prompt-uplift`, then
`~/.cache/prompt-uplift`) and never stores the prompt.

The ExecutionContract stays in conversation state. It is not written to
disk.
